      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e963cb63fb6cd34abcb254",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许是我做得不够好，\n才会让你误以为我很无助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c41b6d6bf4e51b1708744859ef77d810ecab02482ab5ed566eac3e8a32ad759",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64f230c87607ea9f52b1dade",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b1bcae8dd06ca009cfca68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很抱歉害你增添无谓的担心。\n那么，我先失陪了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "205bb87cb59022a76a7916ffdfa489556008dfd2501b707ee27c66532da35253",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0150ad8593a0ca4d0f5c1534",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石踩着利落的脚步回到会场。\n她的背影非常挺直，却相当娇小──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aca2d72a600423e45432707161b4a73e5df8c1347d22d99697ab0f5dfc360fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c51160c2a600e76aad6a955c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我总觉得她承受的莫大期待，\n对她纤细的身躯来说，实在太过沉重。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfebb892810c0fac66cf77d8d50182f5348d6701929eab0e746fd3751407eb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38892218f6c2a133b8e45469",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是众所皆知的豪门出身的赛马娘──第一红宝石。\n似乎是因为一些家庭因素，\n才会参加这场派对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda2f32a22fda1cda76c57fc8d842620ccd23e4afdadd4cc1a0ae004346c44ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22f0b5a3da82244c9c8dfa1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "留胡子的绅士",
      "source_fingerprint": "21057d3fd1edd6f51d2590f65ca606c52869c016487aa90a047405f80b928092",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d8111946b32733b5961e532",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这座会场里可没有人不认识你。\n不过，像我这样的无名小卒认得你，\n或许反而会带给你困扰就是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f462b17b4806ffd66ea4610ade4b04ef2f6f7274d6cf81d56fa2be23ba01f990",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80936a09e0932103eb268849",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:171b1c87799e793225bd0a30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你太谦虚了。\n你是负责制作意大利俱乐部队伍制服的\n运动服公司常务董事吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcfe3f52b26996fcdb86cbe43d4d41a40deca2b1d83d9beed3a4e4da71eec587",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ae384d5c0efd4871b61314e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb2a752313b4fc883359860f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──好久不见。\n你从祖母仍在参赛时就很照顾我们家族，\n我在此向你致谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d67d416b6aae7134bc1c17ef6f9d78d462b9158c43b994e65bd3acec8ffad0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccde124fcc466d202296ef47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石在众多\n知名业界人士的环绕下丝毫不显畏缩，\n与周遭的人对答如流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c290a8f6bd15d6354ebd756193e69c0652857509bc83e8a9635da22c2d8462",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c195065f317f44e5670782",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有年纪的绅士",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f03c04c82c59a3843af4e77c79f93952bf6ff6ad3ccca053e70264b2da25b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccc0e35da8e219ed52164064",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀～你的长相真有点你奶奶的影子呢。\n让我不禁想起当年──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f027d55fdb9e715f2adfefe45971a0982b65c0ec6b1fddcd227f30432f83cdd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b97ccb177a03e168a207a7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "何故展现坚强一面",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e411b32f1dd9ebe48823ac7a26f0745f15a560de1720e0e20cb91d17d5eaf9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420fa2b948d2d1708760c5c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我目送一辆看起来很高级的车子离开。\n那似乎是第一红宝石家的接送车。",
      "source_fingerprint": "babf5460527626252fbd2476eb2568b4bc45cde14ee4f21a2e2c6e1138e082d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed88d26bbfbfaa9308edc33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起因是我在路上帮助不小心跌倒的\n日式点心店的老婆婆时，碰巧经过的第一红宝石\n便载着我们到老婆婆的店里去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a81d21391d7cfcda7b86a3ea0000b438d6b4c4da9c46a34bd5f2784561da1bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a553a69aa0f070ab1449b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "30eed8eb8e7413f1b8ac9652e49932945990eb1076c5a9069bcd13a6358f732c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2b5e1d3b37249e228830c4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac2ed51a4f1bab94d7cfad72158d24dc1b65b6e98236640c4943c73987c0fb8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddbe8dfb3091deafde344d21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红宝石帮忙顾店？\n听起来蛮有趣的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d996048e2121926fcbb1028bbc565e46e1906585d03ea90d7e55b644cab8a804",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c45aea9d417cb909a593a97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表是特雷森学园数一数二\n我行我素的赛马娘。我向她解释\n刚才发生的事情跟感到担心的理由──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ff0cbfb70ab51643d49fdd9d9022b73f94cb13c5c2431fb6a300677ddecec9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad98c556331b3c8aafa2b0cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac2ed51a4f1bab94d7cfad72158d24dc1b65b6e98236640c4943c73987c0fb8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114002.json",
